	Let $\spec_r(p)$ denote the spectral bound of order $r$ for the Choi-Lam form $p \in \R[x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4,u]$. Then, we have	$p_{\min}=0$ and $\spec_r(p)=\Omega(1/r^2)$.
